<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 4.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 4.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 04	Aug 01   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  291.430     287.880     247.020   17.98 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.900     307.800     306.830    0.35 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  155.985     155.975     158.970   -1.88 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.256	46.270	47.182   -1.96 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  474.820     472.600     419.180   13.27 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.480     138.470     141.685   -2.26 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.962	15.990	16.185   -1.38 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  245.980     242.300     212.430   15.79 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	   1.8510	1.8480	1.8880   -1.96 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	   1.5450	1.5430	1.5810   -2.28 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.240     190.200     183.135    3.88 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
